                    {
                        "form_id": "f2ddf67e-06ae-47b6-921a-d878f0090e1a",
                        "entry_id": "6445586f-29c7-36a1-a2f0-9a44056b6d37",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "bananophobie"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3cebef79-a256-3e3e-8807-4e59efa30dcd",
                        "entry_id": "6445586f-29c7-36a1-a2f0-9a44056b6d37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Peur panique des bananes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "496b3be1-e5f2-40a8-a481-2163d0f56a5b",
                                "sense_id": "3cebef79-a256-3e3e-8807-4e59efa30dcd",
                                "text": "Cet aveu permet de constater que, dans la famille des phobies alimentaires, la bananaphobie est en bonne place."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2f5c1b1-7bf5-4c3b-a0cf-aa57b861e1af",
                                "sense_id": "3cebef79-a256-3e3e-8807-4e59efa30dcd",
                                "text": "Fran Dando, une jeune mère de famille de 21 ans, est atteinte de la phobie des bananes. Cette peur du fruit jaune est appelée « bananaphobie »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17995e51-0779-46a8-84e4-332b9152088a",
                                "sense_id": "3cebef79-a256-3e3e-8807-4e59efa30dcd",
                                "text": "Cyril Hanouna a choisi de revenir sur un sujet qui a beaucoup buzzé en début de semaine, la phobie improbable de la jeune chanteuse césarisée, sa bananaphobie."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa038425-ce76-4520-936b-bdf9357d4710",
                        "source_entry_id": "6445586f-29c7-36a1-a2f0-9a44056b6d37",
                        "source_sense_id": "3cebef79-a256-3e3e-8807-4e59efa30dcd",
                        "target_lang_word": "bananaphobia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bananaphobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                        "entry_id": "fccd630f-a022-32f1-9116-3f07d4d7c9da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fear, hate, or dislike of bananas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "684ba2d3-177d-43b1-b11b-619fefb261b3",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "[…]in bed by 6:45 each evening and were even forbidden to eat certain foods, such as bananas, until they were twelve. This had the predictable result of inducing a certain amount of bananaphobia as the twelfth birthday approached."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29e2aa8e-e026-439d-8c62-75c26b3dfa4e",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "Somewhere in my past, no doubt, I had a bad experience with lunch rooms, or over-ripe bananas. A psychiatrist would have a term of some sort for the banana-phobia, but this is just one of those things I’ll never overcome.[…]If my banana-phobia is a problem for me, than^([sic]) the parking-as-close-as-possible addict has some real fears to overcome."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0ef868a-efeb-4cec-9769-7bd59ea13d5f",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "It was not until several months ago that I could even buy bananas for my family again. Maybe one day I’ll even be able to eat one. One day. But not yet. I’m still not over my “bananaphobia.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af09aefc-8ef4-4c9f-85d7-33269d338c10",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "Bananaphobia, air-typing and other lunchtime revelations[…]I knew that she at least harbored a strange hatred of bananas, a neurosis that I’d recently discovered when she was driven from my office, shivering in disgust, by a banana sitting on my desk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c1fe5f2-38dc-4d70-9ec6-16a69ee9d946",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "Bananas win the award for “fruit you are least likely to see Elaine eating.” I can’t tell you why — it might be a texture thing. But after hearing a couple of people talk about various banana pudding recipes they had seen lately (including a Food Network chef preparing one similar to this recipe, except using Chessman shortbread cookies), I decided to dive right in, bananaphobia and all!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1030046a-072c-4c6b-a012-d88453f2fc53",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "Boone had one client who was trained to eat a “low carb” diet. “I had to convince her that eating a banana was not a bad thing,” Boone said. For those with banana-phobias, or the rest of us who simply need an update, here is the latest information on five of our favorite foods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3825ad2-1511-4e5a-9c88-473e07e5b05c",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "As Jones’s “bananaphobia” ripened, she’s taken measures to accommodate it. At grocery stores she detours around the banana displays."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e81e25a5-97f7-4046-b119-6a86423e51cf",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "She may fear bananas, but Allison Jones is not yellow about sharing her phobia with the world. Jones, 36, of Hanover, who suffers from bananaphobia, was featured in a People magazine article Sept. 8 about different types of phobias.[…]But Jones said she’s never sought help for her bananaphobia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d98ab314-ff61-457b-a7f3-401b6efde575",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "[…]the early 1700’s, it was noted that nearly every ship that disappeared at sea was carrying a cargo of bananas. Of course the fact that they were sailing from tropical climes might have biased the outcome! Bananaphobia rules !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f576018-1b7b-49f4-bd25-4676cc3e6f9a",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "He just sits up in his treetop where he’ll whimper and he’ll pout, as he has bananaphobia; bananas freak him out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87b9e2b9-c201-4c14-b580-6ca36ca55966",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "The hosts, Frankie and Danger Boy, were talking about people who suffered from bananaphobia—the intense fear of bananas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2a2f72e-9fa6-4191-b01c-5c1d5b7dbbff",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "Jim suffers from bananaphobia, an irrational fear of the bendy, yellow fruit!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87f229bb-9a83-4a87-ab19-9b02a0871218",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "During my time, I have worked with everyone from Olympic athletes to a guy that suffered from Bananaphobia (a fear of bananas)!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16b258dd-0f9f-4837-b601-d9a90e61ef9b",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "HAVING confessed my arachnophobia in these pages, I’ve received what could be a life-changing offer. Would I, read an email, like to attend a “spider courage” workshop and have my fears hypnotised away? Just one session and I’d be cured forever. On forums, enthusiasts rave about hypnotherapy’s effects on everything from anxiety to a fear of heights to bananaphobia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d275fce-2885-4472-aa66-1163570c4dc0",
                                                "sense_id": "4dd45dc9-6a84-3872-be5f-a952864ef520",
                                                "text": "‘And for the record, yes, of course my bananaphobia is real. Why would I lie?’ Erin shuddered. My sister really did have no weaknesses except a weird, crippling fear of bananas. We weren’t allowed them in the house and she avoided them in the supermarket too."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
